              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihe Dawidi yaharura abantu ntiyaharuyemwo abafise imyaka mirongo ibiri canke batarayishikana, kuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarasezeranye ko azogwiza Abisirayeli ngo bangane n’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya atangura guharura abantu ariko ntiyaheza. Uburake buziriringira Abisirayeli kubera ukwo guharurwa, maze ico gitigiri nticandikwa mu gitabu c’ibigenda biraba c’umwami Dawidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
